# The gate a first run stops at. There is no `screen boot` in front of it
# because there is no boot yet: pi asks for a theme and an analytics answer
# before it draws a pane at all, so this screen is the whole of what a person
# starting their first agent sees. The agent is still there afterwards, the way
# pi is: whoever is driving this scenario decides when it ends.
screen setup
sleep 600000
